{
  "name": "dsh-bili-lite",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "极简：给 DSH 装一条小鱼，让 agent 从不睡觉地运营 B 站 —— 它自己排作息与定时任务（没排时宿主按兑底节拍问「现在想干嘛」）；刷视频、看懂、写日记、值得的发一条评论（与主人共用账号）。写额度 / 判重 / 风控熔断 / 计划上限写死在工具里。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "bilibili",
    "agent",
    "diary"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/app/plugin.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/app/plugin.js",
    "./client": "./src/features/settings/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "docs",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node scripts/check-structure.mjs"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
